abstract: "TUT-BM_version1 is a curated image dataset of bone marrow cytology containing images representing 19 leukocyte cell types. The dataset was developed for research on automated bone marrow image analysis, leukocyte classification, and machine-learning methods under naturally occurring class imbalance."

